English text belongs to the original author.

Changes in this build
---------------------

* Russian user interface (English kept; language follows Windows or --lang).
* Safety fixes: redirected %TEMP% is ignored, Windows Update cache is skipped
  while updates are being installed, OneDrive is a protected folder.
* Settings window layout fix (long hints wrapped and clipped).
* Release checksums (SHA256SUMS.txt) and bilingual installer wizard.

